Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sp12in: select production-signed video firmware

Retail Surface TrustZone rejects the test-signed generic VPU image. Select
Microsoft's production-signed payload, supplied separately for the owner's
personal test image. This does not bypass TrustZone authentication.

This is the same device-specific firmware name used by SayaAndy's Surface
packaging. No firmware binary is included in this patch.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-microsoft-sp12in.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-microsoft-sp12in.dts
@@ -1073,3 +1073,4 @@
 &iris {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/x1p42100/Microsoft/Surface12/qcvss8380_pa.mbn";
         status = "okay";
 };
